T*
(2.1 Khong co quy inh nao theo ieu Khoan Logistic nay uoc giai thich rang TikTok la mot) Tj
T*
(ben cua thoa thuan giua Ban va Nguoi Mua oi voi viec mua va ban San Pham. Viec cung cap) Tj
T*
(Dich Vu Logistic boi TikTok hoac ben uoc uy quyen hoac nha thau phu cua TikTok cho Ban) Tj
T*
(khong uoc xem la, ro rang hoac ngu y, tuyen bo, bao am hoac chung thuc boi TikTok ve) Tj
T*
(chat luong, tinh hop phap, hoac tinh tuan thu cua San Pham uoc ban boi Ban. Chi minh Ban) Tj
T*
(phai chiu trach nhiem oi voi San Pham ma Ban ban cho Nguoi Mua.) Tj
T*
(3. Dich Vu Logistic Chang Cuoi Tu ia Phuong en ia Phuong) Tj
T*
(3.1 Cac khoan phi va chi phi ap dung oi voi Dich Vu Logistic va ieu khoan thanh toan se) Tj
T*
(uoc quy inh tai Seller Centre.) Tj
T*
(3.2 Chung Toi co quyen lua chon tu choi van chuyen mot so San Pham nhat inh. Chung Toi) Tj
T*
(co quyen tu choi cung cap Dich Vu Logistic oi voi mot San Pham neu theo y kien cua Chung) Tj
T*
(Toi, viec xu ly va/hoac giao San Pham nhu vay la khong an toan, trai phap luat hoac) Tj
T*
(khong tuan thu cac chinh sach cua TikTok hoac cua ben uoc uy quyen hoac nha thau phu cua) Tj
T*
(TikTok, chang han nhu bat ky mat hang nao uoc quy inh trong Huong Dan Ve Hang Hoa Bi Cam) Tj
T*
(Tren TikTok Shop \(hoac hang hoa bi han che theo cach khac\), hoac bat ky mat hang nao ma) Tj
T*
(khong uoc xac inh, mo ta, ghi nhan hoac ong goi phu hop e am bao viec van chuyen an) Tj
T*
