T*
(thuc, tuyen uong, phuong tien va quy trinh van chuyen, luu tru, xep hoac do hang nao,) Tj
T*
(theo quyet inh cua rieng TikTok cho muc ich thuc hien Dich Vu Logistic ma khong phai) Tj
T*
(thong bao cho Ban.) Tj
T*
