T*
(3.5 Thoi gian khong phai yeu to co ban. Tru khi uoc thoa thuan khac i mot cach cu the) Tj
T*
(bang van ban boi TikTok, thoi gian khong phai la yeu to cot loi theo cac ieu Khoan) Tj
