(Logistic nay. Tru khi uoc thoa thuan khac i mot cach ro rang bang van ban boi TikTok) Tj
T*
(rang mot San Pham phai khoi hanh hoac en tai mot ngay hoac thoi gian cu the, TikTok) Tj
T*
(khong chiu bat ky trach nhiem nao oi voi ngay va thoi gian khoi hanh hoac en cua San) Tj
T*
