(TikTok hoac ai dien cua TikTok co the giam sat va kiem tra truc tiep hoac tu xa oi voi) Tj
T*
(viec ban su dung API va Du Lieu API e am bao ban tuan thu Phu Luc 3 nay. 4.2 Ban phai) Tj
T*
(luu giu cac ho so ay u va chinh xac e chung minh cho viec ban tuan thu Phu Luc 3 nay. 5) Tj
T*
(Bao Mat 5.1 TikTok se thuc hien cac bien phap an toan thuc te, ien tu va van hanh hop ly) Tj
T*
(oi voi TikTok Shop \( Cac Bien Phap Bao Mat \). 5.2 Ban thua nhan va ong y rang: \(a\) bat) Tj
T*
(ke cac Bien Phap Bao Mat do TikTok thuc hien theo oan 6.1, neu mot nha cung cap phan mem) Tj
T*
(oc lap co uoc, su dung hoac tiet lo du lieu va thong tin tu Tai Khoan cua ban ngoai pham) Tj
T*
(vi cho phep ma ban a cap, thi ieu o co the gay ton hai en quyen va loi ich cua ban.) Tj
T*
(Trong truong hop nhu vay, ban co the khoi kien trach nhiem phap ly oi voi cac nha cung) Tj
T*
(cap phan mem oc lap o. Ban ong y mien tru cho TikTok va cac ben lien ket cua TikTok va) Tj
T*
(giu cho TikTok va cac Ben Lien Ket Cua TikTok vo hai truoc bat ky trach nhiem phap ly,) Tj
T*
(ton that hoac thiet hai nao ma ban co the phai ganh chiu vi nguyen nhan neu tren; \(b\)) Tj
T*
(khong co bat ky bien phap ky thuat nao co the uoc su dung e loai bo hoan toan cac rui ro) Tj
T*
(bao mat. Do o, e giam tac ong cua vi-rut may tinh, ma oc, loi, v.v., chi minh ban phai) Tj
T*
(chiu trach nhiem thuc hien cac bien phap an toan thich hop nhu cai at phan mem chong vi-) Tj
T*
(rut phu hop va cap nhat tren phan cung cua ban; va \(c\) chi minh ban phai chiu trach) Tj
T*
(nhiem oi voi tat ca hoat ong tren TikTok Shop hoac TTTTTTS dien ra duoi danh nghia hoac) Tj
T*
(thong qua viec su dung Tai Khoan cua ban, bat ke cac hoat ong o uoc cho phep hoac thuc) Tj
T*
(hien boi \(i\) ban, \(ii\) nhung nguoi dung khac uoc ban cho phep, hoac \(iii\) bat ky nguoi) Tj
T*
ET
